cnt={"사건":0,"지표":0,"해석":0,"전망":0}; L={"사건":"E","지표":"M","해석":"I","전망":"F"}; amap={}
order=[r for r in R if r["type"]=="사건"]; order.sort(key=lambda r:r["date"])
for t in ("지표","전망","해석"): order+=[r for r in R if r["type"]==t]
for r in order:
    cnt[r["type"]]+=1; r["id"]=f"{Q}-{L[r['type']]}-{cnt[r['type']]:03d}"; amap[r["k"]]=r["id"]
for r in order:
    if "basis" in r: r["basis"]=[amap[b] for b in r["basis"]]
    r.pop("k"); r["added_on"]="2026-10-20"; r["first_seen"]="R1"; r["question"]=Q
    if r["claim_type"]=="자사 집계" and not r.get("external_check"): r["external_check"]=NOEXT
    if "flags" in r: r["check_flags"]=r.pop("flags")
json.dump(amap,open(Path(__file__).with_name("s3_amap.json"),"w"),ensure_ascii=False,indent=0)
out=ROOT/"samsung/s3"
(out/"records_base.jsonl").write_text("".join(json.dumps(r,ensure_ascii=False)+"\n" for r in sorted(order,key=lambda r:r["id"])),encoding="utf-8")
(out/"patches.jsonl").write_text("",encoding="utf-8")
print(cnt,"sources:",len({s["url"] for r in order for s in r.get("sources",[])}))
